# Mutations for mutate.py. Each one swaps a piece of ChunkPipeline.tla for a
# plausible bug and names the one property that must fail on it. The text
# after `- ` must occur exactly once in the spec; `+ ` lines replace it. An
# optional `only <label-substring>` line limits the matrix runs. Every property
# the matrix checks needs a mutation.
#
# Every mutation is limited to two-buffer runs. The one-buffer run fails
# Ownership without any mutation, so it would count as a detection of anything.

mutation chunk counter skips an item
detects TypeOK
only slots=2 items=1 failure=none
- nextItem' = nextItem + 1
+ nextItem' = nextItem + 2

mutation every chunk uses the first rotation buffer
detects Ownership
only slots=2 items=3 failure=none
- Slot(i) == ((i - 1) % Slots) + 1
+ Slot(i) == 1

mutation chunk dropped on a compute error is not recorded as discarded
detects Partition
only slots=2 items=3 failure=compute-all
- /\ discarded' = discarded \cup {current}
+ /\ discarded' = discarded

mutation compute reads the other rotation buffer
detects Order
only slots=2 items=3 failure=none
- output' = Append(output, contents[Slot(current)])
+ output' = Append(output, contents[Slot(current + 1)])

mutation compute writes its chunk twice
detects NoDuplicate
only slots=2 items=3 failure=none
- output' = Append(output, contents[Slot(current)])
+ output' = Append(output, contents[Slot(current)]) \o <<contents[Slot(current)]>>

mutation background error reported before the current chunk is computed
detects ErrorOrder
only slots=2 items=3 failure=prepare-all
- Await == /\ fg = "await" /\ bg \in Settled
+ Await == /\ fg \in {"await", "idle"} /\ bg \in Settled

mutation join leaves the buffer leases in place
detects NoLeak
only slots=2 items=3 failure=none
- /\ owner' = [s \in 1..Slots |-> "free"]
+ /\ UNCHANGED owner

# The executor before it had a completion barrier.
mutation interrupted join returns while the worker still rotates
detects BlasLifetime
only interrupted-join
- report = "compute-error" /\ bg = "rotate"
-                    /\ fg' = "join"
+ report = "compute-error" /\ bg = "rotate"
+                    /\ fg' = "restore"

mutation later chunks are computed after a compute error
detects NoOutputAfterTerminal
only slots=2 items=3 failure=compute-all
- THEN /\ report' = "compute-error" /\ fg' = "error"
+ THEN /\ report' = "compute-error" /\ fg' = "await"

mutation join retries for ever after the worker has finished
detects BlockingReturns
only slots=2 items=3 failure=none
- /\ current' = 0 /\ future' = 0 /\ bg' = "off" /\ fg' = "restore"
+ /\ current' = 0 /\ future' = 0 /\ bg' = "off" /\ fg' = "join"

mutation restoring the BLAS limits never completes close
detects CloseTerminates
only slots=2 items=3 failure=none
- Restore == /\ fg = "restore" /\ fg' = "closed"
+ Restore == /\ fg = "restore" /\ fg' = "restore"

mutation an ended or failed pipeline is never unwound
detects UnwindTerminates
only slots=2 items=3 failure=none
- AutoUnwind == /\ fg \in {"ended", "error"} /\ fg' = "join"
+ AutoUnwind == /\ fg \in {"ended", "error"} /\ fg' = fg

mutation a pipeline that reaches the end of its input is never unwound
detects NoCloseReachesEnd
only slots=2 items=3 failure=none
- AutoUnwind == /\ fg \in {"ended", "error"} /\ fg' = "join"
+ AutoUnwind == /\ fg \in {"error"} /\ fg' = "join"
